# Never upload local secrets or state as build source.
#
# `gcloud builds submit` tars this directory and uploads it before building anything. gcloud
# derives a default ignore list from `.gitignore` when no `.gcloudignore` exists, which is an
# implicit dependency: edit `.gitignore` one day and the master token in `.env` could silently
# end up in the upload bucket.
#
# This file makes the exclusions explicit and independent of `.gitignore`.
# `.dockerignore` is a separate mechanism and does not cover the upload.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
.tools/
state.json
before-write.json
*.snapshot.json
gate2-log.jsonl
__pycache__/
*.pyc
